{"font_size": 0.4, "font_color": "#FFFFFF", "background_alpha": 0.5, "background_color": "#9C27B0", "Stroke": "none", "type": "AIsubtitle", "lang": "zh", "version": "1.5.0", "body": [{"from": 0.82, "to": 1.76, "sid": 1, "location": 2, "content": "大家好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 1.76, "to": 3.17, "sid": 2, "location": 2, "content": "这里是琪露诺", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 3.17, "to": 6.59, "sid": 3, "location": 2, "content": "这一期我给大家全面并剪辑的安利一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 6.59, "to": 7.82, "sid": 4, "location": 2, "content": "练枪软件", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 7.82, "to": 8.99, "sid": 5, "location": 2, "content": "Kwak", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 8.99, "to": 12.46, "sid": 6, "location": 2, "content": "这个软件最早可以追溯到2018年", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 12.46, "to": 14.89, "sid": 7, "location": 2, "content": "那时候的大家刚刚萌生出", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 14.89, "to": 18.32, "sid": 8, "location": 2, "content": "对于游戏内训练场的环境不够纯粹", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 18.32, "to": 20.93, "sid": 9, "location": 2, "content": "不足以练习到纯粹的瞄准能力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 20.93, "to": 24.8, "sid": 10, "location": 2, "content": "想要找到更纯粹的练习瞄准的辅助方式", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 24.9, "to": 25.98, "sid": 11, "location": 2, "content": "2018年", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 25.98, "to": 29.7, "sid": 12, "location": 2, "content": "刚开始还只是有hero in booster", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 29.7, "to": 32.91, "sid": 13, "location": 2, "content": "这种2D平面下的经典练习软件", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 32.91, "to": 36.7, "sid": 14, "location": 2, "content": "如今这种模式已经非常完善", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 40.27, "to": 43.99, "sid": 15, "location": 2, "content": "不少的瞄准社区正在使用这种方法", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 43.99, "to": 46.76, "sid": 16, "location": 2, "content": "提高多元化的瞄准能力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 46.76, "to": 51.18, "sid": 17, "location": 2, "content": "那么kook可以练习到的瞄准能力有哪些呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 51.18, "to": 53.88, "sid": 18, "location": 2, "content": "从静态定位到动态定位", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 53.88, "to": 55.66, "sid": 19, "location": 2, "content": "平滑跟枪反应", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 55.66, "to": 57.52, "sid": 20, "location": 2, "content": "跟枪静态转火", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 57.52, "to": 58.87, "sid": 21, "location": 2, "content": "动态转火", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 58.87, "to": 64.7, "sid": 22, "location": 2, "content": "涵盖了从短TTK到长TTK所有需要的瞄准能力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 66.26, "to": 69.88, "sid": 23, "location": 2, "content": "但只是有场景可以边移动边跟枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 69.88, "to": 75.16, "sid": 24, "location": 2, "content": "这种帮助你协调左手与右手之间的协作", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 75.16, "to": 78.19, "sid": 25, "location": 2, "content": "在游戏中你肯定察觉到了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 78.19, "to": 80.04, "sid": 26, "location": 2, "content": "有时候自己瞄不到", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 80.04, "to": 82.94, "sid": 27, "location": 2, "content": "就差一点的残局就能获胜了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 82.94, "to": 84.53, "sid": 28, "location": 2, "content": "有更多瞄准能力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 84.53, "to": 87.38, "sid": 29, "location": 2, "content": "意味着你能使用的战术更多", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 87.38, "to": 90.4, "sid": 30, "location": 2, "content": "你可以更有把握的承担风险", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 90.4, "to": 91.72, "sid": 31, "location": 2, "content": "更大的选择", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 91.72, "to": 97.45, "sid": 32, "location": 2, "content": "以及有的游戏里你可以更加享受瞄准的过程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 97.45, "to": 100.84, "sid": 33, "location": 2, "content": "比如quick这类纯粹的瞄准游戏", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 100.84, "to": 104.14, "sid": 34, "location": 2, "content": "以及瞄准频率非常高的ow", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 105.22, "to": 108.28, "sid": 35, "location": 2, "content": "在这种你需要系统练习多重瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 108.28, "to": 113.05, "sid": 36, "location": 2, "content": "以及想要体验高瞄准能力带来的快感的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 113.05, "to": 118.54, "sid": 37, "location": 2, "content": "这个时候kook就会发挥出它应有的作用", "music": 0.13526569721580495}, {"from": 118.64, "to": 122.08, "sid": 38, "location": 2, "content": "首先我们先教大家简易设置一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 122.08, "to": 123.46, "sid": 39, "location": 2, "content": "加速steam", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 123.46, "to": 126.55, "sid": 40, "location": 2, "content": "打开steam的商店搜索kook", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 126.55, "to": 131.94, "sid": 41, "location": 2, "content": "然后下载完成之后打开打开setting", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 132.16, "to": 135.28, "sid": 42, "location": 2, "content": "我们从第一页依次往go设置", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 136.16, "to": 140.7, "sid": 43, "location": 2, "content": "首先看到FOV调整至ow03", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 140.7, "to": 142.26, "sid": 44, "location": 2, "content": "这是一个标准值", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 142.26, "to": 144.45, "sid": 45, "location": 2, "content": "有利于你接下来的练习", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 144.45, "to": 145.77, "sid": 46, "location": 2, "content": "记住一点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 145.77, "to": 148.66, "sid": 47, "location": 2, "content": "练习的不是练的FOV", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 148.66, "to": 152.8, "sid": 48, "location": 2, "content": "而是念你的特定场景下的瞄准能力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 152.8, "to": 157.76, "sid": 49, "location": 2, "content": "然后我们找到主题go选第二个选项的go", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 157.76, "to": 162.22, "sid": 50, "location": 2, "content": "有些作者的作图主题会自动设置为阴间场景", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 162.22, "to": 163.96, "sid": 51, "location": 2, "content": "比如ANGELLIT", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 165.04, "to": 167.82, "sid": 52, "location": 2, "content": "然后我们可以在第三个选项", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 167.82, "to": 172.86, "sid": 53, "location": 2, "content": "在这灵敏度涵盖了多个游戏引擎的灵敏度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 172.86, "to": 177.5, "sid": 54, "location": 2, "content": "并且有一个多少厘米能转360度的切换", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 177.5, "to": 178.34, "sid": 55, "location": 2, "content": "数值", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 178.34, "to": 181.91, "sid": 56, "location": 2, "content": "可以通过来回切换来换算", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 181.91, "to": 184.78, "sid": 57, "location": 2, "content": "多种游戏内的灵敏度数值", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 184.78, "to": 189.36, "sid": 58, "location": 2, "content": "dpi就选择你鼠标的dpi调到最下面", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 189.36, "to": 192.57, "sid": 59, "location": 2, "content": "第一个是你游戏中最大帧数", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 192.57, "to": 195.82, "sid": 60, "location": 2, "content": "第二个是你菜单的最大帧数", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 195.82, "to": 200.54, "sid": 61, "location": 2, "content": "如果把菜单的帧数设置的跟游戏帧数不太一样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 200.54, "to": 203.09, "sid": 62, "location": 2, "content": "他有可能会出现卡顿的情况", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 203.09, "to": 206.54, "sid": 63, "location": 2, "content": "最后一个是这局开始时的道具时", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 206.54, "to": 208.82, "sid": 64, "location": 2, "content": "让你可以有所准备", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 208.82, "to": 211.22, "sid": 65, "location": 2, "content": "第二页是键位绑定", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 211.22, "to": 215.8, "sid": 66, "location": 2, "content": "这个主要的作用是你可以设置重开的按键", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 215.8, "to": 219.64, "sid": 67, "location": 2, "content": "以及你在不小心切换了其他武器的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 219.64, "to": 224.35, "sid": 68, "location": 2, "content": "有的时候会出现开枪无法命中目标的情况", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 224.35, "to": 227.28, "sid": 69, "location": 2, "content": "第三页是五武器的选项", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 227.28, "to": 229.77, "sid": 70, "location": 2, "content": "这一页的go全部去掉", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 229.77, "to": 233.56, "sid": 71, "location": 2, "content": "因为武器的模型会挡住你的部分目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 233.56, "to": 236.89, "sid": 72, "location": 2, "content": "来影响你放在目标上的专注度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 236.89, "to": 240.11, "sid": 73, "location": 2, "content": "包括hit Mark也要全部去掉", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 240.11, "to": 242.959, "sid": 74, "location": 2, "content": "这个是击中目标后的反馈", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 242.959, "to": 246.679, "sid": 75, "location": 2, "content": "会对你正常练习有很大的影响", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 246.679, "to": 250.339, "sid": 76, "location": 2, "content": "随后我们来到第四项画面", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 250.339, "to": 253.24, "sid": 77, "location": 2, "content": "设置这一页我就全部打开", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 253.24, "to": 254.59, "sid": 78, "location": 2, "content": "慢慢缓一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 254.59, "to": 256.82, "sid": 79, "location": 2, "content": "大家可以截个图看一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 256.82, "to": 258.08, "sid": 80, 